# 
# Flanges Thickness and Diameter to Superelement op2 file Map
# format : diam, num_sheets, t1, t2, ..., tn, yound_modulus1, ..., yound_modulusn, op2 filename path, superelement id, diagonal_1, diagonal_2, ..., diagonal_n,{attachment_points_1}, {attachment_points_2}, ..., {attachment_points_n}
# 

# 

# 
# Flanges Thickness and Diameter to Superelement Library File Map
